  "claim": "Peter 'Drago' Sell is the name of the black belt in Brizilian Jiu Jitsu who trains extensively under striking coach Ray Bronx Longo in the founding city of TIAS.com.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Pete Sell. Sentence: Peter 'Drago' Sell, (born August 5, 1982) is an American mixed martial artist specializing in Brazilian Jiu Jitsu.\nPage: Pete Sell. Sentence: He is a black belt under teacher and fellow mixed martial artist Matt Serra in East Meadow, New York, and has trained extensively under striking coach Ray Bronx Longo in Garden City, New York.\nPage: Garden City, New York. Sentence: Garden City is an incorporated village in the town of Hempstead, in central Nassau County, New York, in the United States.\nPage: TIAS.com. Sentence: The company was founded in 1995 and is based in Garden City, New York.",
