        "original_id": "44204275-f995-5a24-a45f-fa12b65da79e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pete Sell, Matt Serra, Ray Bronx Longo\n- Places: Garden City, East Meadow, Hempstead, Nassau County, New York, United States\n- Companies: TIAS.com\n- Roles: mixed martial artist, teacher, striking coach, black belt\n\nFacts:\n- TIAS.com was founded in 1995 and is based in Garden City, New York.\n- Pete Sell was born on August 5, 1982.\n- Pete Sell is an American mixed martial artist who specializes in Brazilian Jiu Jitsu.\n- Matt Serra is Pete Sell’s teacher and a fellow mixed martial artist.\n- Pete Sell is a black belt under Matt Serra in East Meadow, New York.\n- Pete Sell trained extensively under striking coach Ray Bronx Longo in Garden City, New York.\n- Garden City is an incorporated village in the town of Hempstead in central Nassau County, New York, United States.",
